_model: definition
---
title: Definition 8
---
order: 8
---
short_label: III.Def.8
---
statement: An <i>angle in a segment</i> is the angle which, when a point is taken on the circumference of the segment and straight lines are joined from it to the ends of the straight line which is the base of the segment, is contained by the straight lines so joined.
---
group: defIII6_9
